Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:00:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: hardware video decode (linux-aurora
 j714s3-7, omarchy-aurora-firmware j714s7)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-7 adds the J714s video decoder to the
device tree (DjDeveloperr's #1577); omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s7
builds avd-fw v5-t2 for it. From betizzel/omarchy-m5 (3327d427).
